  "description": "The Deliciu Mate Kit boasts an 800mAh rechargeable battery capable of supporting up to 3 pods on a full charge, ensuring longer vaping sessions with minimal downtime. With Inhale activation, using the Deliciu Mate is as simple as taking a puff. The LED light indicators conveniently show your battery level, so you always know when it’s time to recharge. With its portable and durable design, the Deliciu Mate Kit is available in various stylish colours, allowing you to choose the perfect match for your style. Besides the included 2ml prefilled pod, the device is compatible with Vaporesso’s refillable XROS pods (0.8-1.2Ω recommended). Both pod types feature Vaporesso's advanced COREX 2.0 mesh coil technology, providing dense, flavourful vapour with every puff. Whether you opt for the convenience of choosing from 15 prefilled Deliciu pod flavours or prefer using your own vape juice in an XROS pod, the Deliciu Mate delivers outstanding performance and flexibility. The Deliciu Mate Prefilled Pod Vape kits come in a selection of 15 different flavours all 20mg and 6 different kit colours. Please see below for the prefilled pods that come with each colour Kit. Black: Watermelon Ice, Blackberry Lime or Pineapple Orange Blue: Strawberry Raspberry Cherry Ice, Kiwi Passion Fruit Guava or Raspberry Key Lime Grey: Fizzy Cherry, Menthol or Strawberry Kiwi Rose Pink: Apple & Pear or Pink Lemonade Lilac Purple: Blueberry Sour Raspberry or Grape Sunset Orange: Pineapple Ice or Lemon Lime",
